# Athlevo — files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# api/terra/ is the DORMANT Terra gateway. Its behaviour now lives in the
# generic api/providers/index.js router (?provider=terra), so deploying the
# old file would spend one of the 12 Hobby-plan serverless function slots on
# a duplicate that nothing calls.
#
# Excluded rather than deleted so the original is still in the repo and the
# change is trivially reversible: delete this line to bring it back.
api/terra/

# api/admin/ — the beta-analytics endpoint was FOLDED into the generic
# gateway (api/providers/index.js?action=admin_analytics) so that adding the
# Whop webhook (api/whop/webhook.js) keeps the deployed function count at 12
# (the Hobby cap). The old standalone file is superseded and excluded rather
# than deleted, so the change is reversible.
api/admin/

# Not part of the deployed app.
migrations/
tests/

# scratch artefact — delete before committing
*.dbg
